  "productDetails": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "机器狗外形，八轮结构",
        "en": "A robot-dog body on eight wheels"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/599-51/544e33fc2aa5.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "银灰色机身采用机器狗外形，侧面轮组与关节结构在图片中清楚可见。它以遥控车的方式操作，搭配灯光和音效，玩法围绕行驶与特技动作展开。",
        "en": "The silver-gray body has a robot-dog shape, with wheel assemblies and joints visible at the sides. It operates as an RC vehicle with lights and sound for driving and stunt play."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "2.4 GHz遥控与声光效果",
        "en": "2.4 GHz control with lights and sound"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/599-51/5816368a2547.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "这款使用2.4 GHz遥控。机身的显示区域、轮组和上部造型分别在配图中展示，选购时可以先看清结构，再核对自己需要的遥控玩法。",
        "en": "The model uses 2.4 GHz remote control. Product images show the display area, wheel assemblies and upper body so the construction can be viewed before choosing the model."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "机身包电，遥控器另备电池",
        "en": "Included product battery; separate controller batteries"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/599-51/8c9666ee06e8.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "机身含3.7 V、500 mAh电池，随附USB充电线。遥控器需要三节AAA电池，需自行准备；两部分供电不同，首次使用前可一并备齐。",
        "en": "A 3.7 V, 500 mAh product battery and USB charging cable are included. The controller needs three AAA batteries, supplied separately. Prepare the controller batteries before the first session."
      }
    }
  ],
